%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 54346c1d6124c684786b9565e639885c, type: 3}
  m_Name: Round2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  responses:
  - lines:
    - text: I think I really felt it when I left Schiphol.
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b8340e73f8b75fc49872a5baa48529cf, type: 3}
    - text: Everything was so green, almost too green.
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b069b0162cb57a42b571b35bdd5f1f7, type: 3}
    - text: Everywhere around us was green, while I was used to yellow in Iraq.
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 56ae68dde5e202442af20615dcf168b2, type: 3}
    - text: It immediately felt different, like I was in another world.
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5a9373ce436dddd41b08b8d197238231, type: 3}
    - text: On that first day, I saw an elderly woman riding a bicycle and my heart
        started beating faster.
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 52c1687365c86714b9bfabd17cecca48, type: 3}
    - text: I honestly thought if she falls now, she will die, because where I come
        from, older women did not do things like that at all.
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 32a04d723892c674fb180f1635571ff1, type: 3}
  - lines:
    - text: The first time I had to leave Iraq, I went to Iran.
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b8340e73f8b75fc49872a5baa48529cf, type: 3}
    - text: Because we were Kurds and connected to the peshmerga, we were expelled
        from the country.
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b069b0162cb57a42b571b35bdd5f1f7, type: 3}
    - text: I was ten years old at the time, and they are not pleasant memories.
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 56ae68dde5e202442af20615dcf168b2, type: 3}
    - text: But there was not much to do there, so I started helping with cooking.
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5a9373ce436dddd41b08b8d197238231, type: 3}
    - text: I learned how to fill kobeh and how to knead bread.
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 52c1687365c86714b9bfabd17cecca48, type: 3}
    - text: That was the first time I really felt like I could help.
      sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 32a04d723892c674fb180f1635571ff1, type: 3}
